OL,3,GNEWSACulture Night hoping for fleadh
OL,4,Aboost as it returns to Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of Culture Night Belfast
OL,7,Fare hoping the city can build on the
OL,8,Fsuccess of the Fleadh Cheoil na
OL,9,FhEireann (All-Ireland Fleadh), as it
OL,10,Fdelivers more than 200 free events on
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,13,FThe fleadh last month exceeded
OL,14,Fexpectations, bringing 1.6m visits to
OL,15,Fthe city over eight days of
OL,16,Fcelebrations.
OL,18,FDirector of Culture Night Belfast, Lois
OL,19,FKennedy, said she believes Belfast is
OL,20,F"moving forward" and hopes that can now
OL,21,Fbe enhanced further.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
