OL,3,GNEWSACulture Night hoping for fleadh
OL,4,Aboost as it returns to Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We all know the vibrancy that came
OL,7,Ffrom the fleadh, we don't have the same
OL,8,Fresources and budgets of the fleadh,
OL,9,Fbut we think it will be another amazing
OL,10,Fevent on the night."
